       "explainHtml": "חח״ע: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>dim</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dim\\mathrm{Ker}\\,T=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>dim</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>dim</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dim\\mathrm{Im}\\,T=\\dim M_{2\\times2}(\\mathbb{R})-0=4</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מכיוון ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>dim</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dim\\mathbb{R}_3[x]=4</annotation></semantics></math></span> ההעתקה גם על."
